msgid "Exporting for Linux"
msgstr "為 Linux 匯出"

msgid ""
"This page describes how to export a Godot project to Linux. If you're "
"looking to compile editor or export template binaries from source instead, "
"read :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd`."
msgstr ""
"這個頁面描述的是如何將 Godot 專案匯出到 Linux。如果你想要找的是從源碼編譯編輯"
"器或匯出範本二進位檔案，請閱讀 :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` 。"

msgid ""
"The simplest way to distribute a game for PC is to copy the executable "
"(``godot``), compress the folder and send it to someone else. However, this "
"is often not desired."
msgstr ""
"要為 PC 發行遊戲最簡單的方法就是複製可執行檔 (Windows 上為 ``godot.exe`` ，其"
"餘為 ``godot``)，壓縮資料夾並將壓縮檔傳送給其他人。但我們通常不想這麼做。"

msgid ""
"Godot offers a more elegant approach for PC distribution when using the "
"export system. When exporting for Linux, the exporter takes all the project "
"files and creates a ``data.pck`` file. This file is bundled with a specially "
"optimized binary that is smaller, faster and does not contain the editor and "
"debugger."
msgstr ""
"通過匯出系統，Godot 提供一種更優雅的方法來在 PC 平台上發行。為 PC 平台匯出時 "
"(Linux, Windows, macOS)，匯出工具會以所有的專案檔案建立成一個 ``data.pck`` 檔"
"案。該檔案會內涵一個特別最佳化過的二進位，這個二進位檔更小、更快，而且不包含"
"編輯器與除錯工具。"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架構"

msgid ""
"There are 7 different processor architectures that exported Godot projects "
"can run on in Linux:"
msgstr "匯出的 Godot 專案在 Linux 系統上可以執行於 7 種不同的處理器架構："

msgid "x86_64"
msgstr "x86_64"

msgid "x86_32"
msgstr "x86_32"

msgid "arm64"
msgstr "arm64"

msgid "arm32"
msgstr "arm32"

msgid "rv64"
msgstr "rv64"

msgid "ppc64"
msgstr "ppc64"

msgid "loongarch64"
msgstr "loongarch64"

msgid ""
"The default is x86_64, this is the most common architecture of PC processors "
"today. All modern Intel and AMD processors as of writing this are x86_64."
msgstr ""
"預設是 x86_64，這也是當今 PC 處理器最常見的架構。在撰寫本文時，所有現代的英特"
"爾（Intel）和 AMD 處理器都屬於 x86_64 架構。"

msgid ""
"x86_32 will give you a 32bit executable that can run on 32bit only "
"distributions of Linux as well as some modern distributions that are 64bit. "
"It is NOT recommended to use this option unless you are trying to get your "
"project to run on an old 32bit distribution and processor. It should also be "
"noted that several prominent distributions, such as Fedora, have been "
"discussing removing their 32bit libraries which would prevent executables "
"made this way from running on future versions of that distribution."
msgstr ""
"x86_32 會生成一個 32 位元的可執行檔，它既可以在純 32 位元的 Linux 發行版上執"
"行，也能在如今主流的 64 位元發行版上執行。不過，並不推薦使用這個選項，除非你"
"是為了能讓專案在老舊的 32 位元 Linux 發行版和處理器上跑起來。另外需要注意的"
"是，目前有幾個主流的發行版（比如 Fedora）已經在討論逐步移除它們的 32 位元庫"
"了，這意味著以後用這種方式打包出來的可執行檔，很可能無法在這些發行版的未來版"
"本上正常執行。"

msgid ""
"arm64 executables can run on 64bit ARM processors. If you're familiar with "
"the Raspberry Pi, those have utilized 64bit ARM processors since the Pi 3 "
"(older versions used 32bit ARM processors). If you're uploading to a "
"platform that supports multiple executables, such as itch.io, and you're "
"confident your game could run on a common ARM computer, such as the Pi 5, "
"then we'd recommend exporting this version and providing it as an option."
msgstr ""
"ARM64 可執行檔可以在 64 位元 ARM 處理器上執行。如果你熟悉樹莓派（Raspberry "
"Pi）的話，它們從樹莓派 3 開始就使用了 64 位元 ARM 處理器（更早的版本用的是 "
"32 位元 ARM 處理器）。如果你要把項目上傳到像 itch.io 這樣支援上傳多個可執行檔"
"的平台，並且你有信心你的遊戲可以在常見的 ARM 電腦（比如樹莓派 5）上流暢執行，"
"那麼我們推薦你匯出這個版本，並把它作為一個額外的選項提供給玩家。"

msgid ""
"arm32 executables are for older 32bit arm processors, such as what the "
"Raspberry Pi 1 and 2 used. Given that they're not common at all these days "
"we do not recommend exporting for this unless you have a computer with one "
"of these processors you know you can, and want to have your game running on."
msgstr ""
"arm32 可執行檔是專為較老款的 32 位元 arm 處理器準備的，比如樹莓派 1 代和 2 代"
"用的就是這種處理器。鑒於如今這類裝置已經極其少見了，我們並不推薦大家專門去匯"
"出這個版本——除非你手頭正好有一台搭載這種處理器的電腦，並且你確實希望自己的遊"
"戲能在它上面執行。"

msgid ""
"rv64 is for RISC-V processors, ppc64 is for 64bit PowerPC processors, and "
"loongarch64 is for 64bit LoongArch processors. All of these architectures "
"are substantially more niche when it comes to running videogames on them. "
"And we only recommend exporting for them if you have a reason to, such as if "
"you're an enthusiast who owns hardware. Official export templates are not "
"provided by Godot, you will have to create them on your own. Instructions "
"for compiling the engine for RISC-V and creating export templates can be "
"found on the :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` page."
msgstr ""
"rv64 是給 RISC-V 處理器用的，ppc64 是給 64 位元的 PowerPC 處理器用的，而 "
"loongarch64 則是給 64 位元的 LoongArch（龍芯架構）處理器用的。拿這些架構來玩"
"遊戲目前來說是非常小眾的。所以我們只推薦在你有明確需求的情況下才去匯出這些版"
"本，比如你是個硬體發燒友，手頭正好有搭載這些處理器的裝置。Godot 官方不會提供"
"這些架構的匯出範本，你需要自己動手編譯生成。關於如何為 RISC-V 編譯引擎以及製"
"作匯出範本的詳細說明，可以在 :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` 頁面中找到。"

msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "環境變數"

msgid ""
"You can use the following environment variables to set export options "
"outside of the editor. During the export process, these override the values "
"that you set in the export menu."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用下列環境變數在編輯器外部設定匯出選項。在匯出過程中，這些值會覆寫您"
"在匯出選單中設定的值。"

msgid "Linux export environment variables"
msgstr "Linux 匯出環境變數"

msgid "Export option"
msgstr "匯出選項"

msgid "Environment variable"
msgstr "環境變數"

msgid "Encryption / Encryption Key"
msgstr "加密／加密金鑰"

msgid "``GODOT_SCRIPT_ENCRYPTION_KEY``"
msgstr "``GODOT_SCRIPT_ENCRYPTION_KEY``"

msgid "Export options"
msgstr "匯出選項"

msgid ""
"You can find a full list of export options available in "
"the :ref:`class_EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD` class reference."
msgstr ""
"完整的可用匯出選項列表請見 :ref:`class_EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD` 類別參"
"考。"
